cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use certtables, please cite it as below."
title: certtables
abstract: >-
  Interval-certified (Arb ball arithmetic) reference values for statistical quantiles,
  tail probabilities, exact-test null distributions and group-sequential boundaries, with a
  digits-correct census of SciPy, statsmodels, mpmath and spotify-confidence against them.
type: software
authors:
  - name: h-a-forster
repository-code: "https://github.com/h-a-forster/certtables"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-06"
keywords:
  - numerical accuracy
  - interval arithmetic
  - statistical software
  - group sequential designs
  - exact tests
